# Per-Dockerfile dockerignore for the bootstrap-db image.
#
# BuildKit picks this up before falling back to the repo-root .dockerignore.
# The build context is the repo root (the workflow runs `docker build -f
# infra/bootstrap-db/Dockerfile .`), but this image only needs ONE file —
# the bootstrap script — so we exclude everything by default and re-include
# just that file. Faster build, smaller context, no risk of leaking
# unrelated repo state into the image's build cache.
#
# The repo-root .dockerignore correctly excludes `infra/` because the
# backend image doesn't need it; that exclusion would otherwise drop the
# bootstrap script from this build context too.

*
!infra/scripts/bootstrap-databases.sh
